WEBVTT

00:04.200 --> 00:08.461
This is eodia insights, open-source BI.

00:08.900 --> 00:13.094
A question is built with the mouse, without a line of SQL.

00:14.450 --> 00:19.216
Calendars, bar races, forecasts: every story has its chart.

00:20.400 --> 00:24.974
And in SQL, PostgreSQL and MongoDB join in the same query.

00:26.450 --> 00:31.069
Or just ask: the AI writes the query and answers with a chart.

00:32.450 --> 00:36.647
Living dashboards: one click, and the whole page filters.

00:38.350 --> 00:40.602
In your colors, all the way to the PDF.

00:42.450 --> 00:46.701
And everyone sees only their own data: Trino itself enforces the permissions.

00:48.450 --> 00:53.209
An API, an MCP server, and a space for each team.

00:54.450 --> 00:58.550
Free and open source, eodia insights keeps your data at home.
